---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="How to Use"
  description="Learn how to use HabitTrack: adding habits, the 3-state cell cycle, reading daily score graphs, and installing offline on your device."
>
  <div class="space-y-8">
    <!-- Hero Card -->
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#1a0b2e] rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-purple-800/50 p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-sm">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-purple-950/60 text-indigo-700 dark:text-purple-300 border border-indigo-100 dark:border-purple-800/60 mb-4">
        <span>📖</span>
        <span>Quickstart Guide</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-50 tracking-tight">
        How to Use HabitTrack
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-200/80 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        A quick 2-minute visual guide to getting the most out of your monthly habit board.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 1: Add Habits -->
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#1a0b2e] rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-purple-800/50 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 dark:bg-purple-600 text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm shadow-sm">1</span>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">Add & Manage Your Habits</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-200/85 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        Click the <strong>"+ Add Habit"</strong> button in the top navigation (or the floating circular <strong>+</strong> button on mobile). You can add as many habits as you want.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-6">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#201038] border border-slate-200/60 dark:border-purple-800/40">
          <div class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-purple-200 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>⠿</span>
            <span>Reorder</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-purple-300/80">
            Click and drag the grip icon on the left of any row to arrange your habits in your preferred order.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#201038] border border-slate-200/60 dark:border-purple-800/40">
          <div class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-purple-200 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>✏️</span>
            <span>Rename</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-purple-300/80">
            Open the three dots (⋮) menu on the right side of a habit row and select "Rename" to update its title anytime.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#201038] border border-slate-200/60 dark:border-purple-800/40">
          <div class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-purple-200 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>🗑️</span>
            <span>Delete</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-purple-300/80">
            Need to retire a habit? Select "Delete" from the menu to remove the row and its historical logs for that month.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 2: The 3-State Tap Cycle -->
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#1a0b2e] rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-purple-800/50 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 dark:bg-purple-600 text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm shadow-sm">2</span>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">The 3-State Cell Cycle</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-200/85 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        No popups, no dropdowns. Tapping or clicking any day cell cycles through 3 simple states:
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mt-6">
        <!-- State 1: Empty -->
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#201038] border border-slate-200 dark:border-purple-800/50 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 border-2 border-slate-400 dark:bg-[#251340] dark:border-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner mb-3">
            <span class="text-transparent">·</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">1. Empty</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-purple-300/80 mt-1">
            Default state waiting for your input. Contributes 0 to daily score.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- State 2: Done -->
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#201038] border border-slate-200 dark:border-purple-800/50 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-green-500/20 border-2 border-green-500/50 text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center text-base shadow-sm mb-3">
            ✔
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">2. Completed (✔)</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-purple-300/80 mt-1">
            Tap once. Marked as finished. Adds +1 point to your daily score.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- State 3: Skipped -->
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#201038] border border-slate-200 dark:border-purple-800/50 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-red-500/20 border-2 border-red-500/50 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center text-base shadow-sm mb-3">
            ✖
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">3. Skipped (✖)</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-purple-300/80 mt-1">
            Tap again. Marks an intentional skip or rest day. Tap once more to reset to empty.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 3: Score Graph & Completion Rate -->
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#1a0b2e] rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-purple-800/50 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 dark:bg-purple-600 text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm shadow-sm">3</span>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">Understanding Daily Scores & Graph</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-200/85 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        Directly below your habit table is the <strong>Daily Score Graph</strong>. It automatically recalculates every time you mark a habit:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-300/90">
        <li><strong>Formula:</strong> Every habit marked with ✔ counts as 1 point. If you have 6 habits and check off 4 on day 8, your day 8 score is 4.</li>
        <li><strong>Smart Completion Rate:</strong> In the current ongoing month, the percentage rate is evaluated only against the days that have already occurred (today and past days), so unlived future days do not penalize your percentage!</li>
        <li><strong>Dotted Reference Line:</strong> Identifies today's date on the graph so you always know where you stand in the month.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 4: PWA Installation -->
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#1a0b2e] rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-purple-800/50 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 dark:bg-purple-600 text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm shadow-sm">4</span>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100">Install as an Offline Mobile App (PWA)</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-purple-200/85 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        HabitTrack can be installed directly onto your device without going through an app store:
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#201038] border border-slate-200/60 dark:border-purple-800/40">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100 flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
            <span>📱</span>
            <span>iPhone / iPad (Safari)</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-purple-300/80">
            Open in Safari, tap the <strong>Share</strong> button, then select <strong>"Add to Home Screen"</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#201038] border border-slate-200/60 dark:border-purple-800/40">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-purple-100 flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
            <span>🤖</span>
            <span>Android (Chrome / Brave)</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-purple-300/80">
            Tap the browser menu (⋮) and select <strong>"Install app"</strong> or <strong>"Add to Home screen"</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick CTA -->
    <div class="text-center pt-4">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-700 dark:bg-purple-600 dark:hover:bg-purple-500 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-xl shadow-sm transition-colors text-sm sm:text-base"
      >
        <span>Open Habit Tracker</span>
        <span>→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
